			],
			"Message": "style(Mist): Adjust emoji spacing and remove link prefix in README\n\nIntroduce a non-breaking space character (`&#x2001;`) before the cloud emoji in the header to align it with the badge layout standards. Remove the generic document icon (`📖`) text prefix from the Rust API Documentation link, retaining the icon only as a suffix to the URL.\n\nThese visual refinements ensure consistent iconography and spacing within the `README.md` documentation for the Mist component, adhering to the project's design token usage.",
