			"Message": "style(Mist): Align component table column widths in README\n\nAdjust the markdown table formatting in README.md to ensure consistent column widths across all entries. Extend trailing whitespace in the description cells for `Zone.rs`, `Resolver.rs`, `ForwardSecurity.rs`, and `WebSocket.rs` to match the alignment established by `lib.rs`.\n\nThis correction preserves the readability of the component overview without altering the underlying documentation content or PascalCase naming conventions.",
